d 'QREG_HAC': module for computing quantile regression with heteroskedasticity- and autocorrelation-consistent (HAC) standard errors
d
d  qreg_hac fits quantile regression models to time-series and
d panel data and reports standard errors that are robust to
d heteroskedasticity and autocorrelation (HAC). The coefficients
d are identical to those of qreg; the variance-covariance matrix is
d the sandwich estimator of Galvao and Yoon (2024), D^-1 J D^-1,
d where D is estimated from the conditional density of the errors
d and J is a kernel-weighted (HAC) estimate of the long-run
d variance of the quantile scores. 
d
d KW: quantile regression
d KW: HAC
d KW: heteroskedasticity
d KW: autocorrelation
d KW: time serie
d
d Requires: Stata version 13
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261122
d
d Author: Ariel Linden, Linden Consulting Group, LLC
d Support: email alinden@@lindenconsulting.org
d
f qreg_hac.ado
f qreg_hac.sthlp
f QREG_HAC_methods.pdf
